          "end_column": 46,
          "symbol": "WovenFusion.forward",
          "expression": "def forward(self, x):\n    a0 = self.p0(x)\n    a1 = self.p1(x)\n    a2 = self.p2(x)\n    b0 = torch.tanh(a0 + a1)\n    b1 = torch.relu(a1 + a2)\n    b2 = unfamiliar_kernel(a2 + a0)\n    c0 = self.q0(b0 + b1)\n    c1 = self.q1(b1 + b2)\n    c2 = self.q2(b2 + b0)\n    return torch.cat((c0, c1, c2), dim=-1)"
        }
      ],
